---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About | Kang-Fu Mei"
			description="Kang-Fu Mei is a research scientist and tech lead working on multimodal generative AI and world models."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, I’m Kang-Fu Mei (梅康夫), a Research Scientist and Tech Lead at Google DeepMind.
				I work on reinforcement learning post-training for multimodal generative and world
				models, spanning reward modeling, data, evaluation, and offline and online RL.
			</p>
			<p>
				My research sits at the intersection of multimodal generative AI and world models. I’m
				interested in building systems that can simulate our dynamic world for creative control,
				more robust autonomous systems, and new entertainment experiences.
			</p>
			<p>
				I received my Ph.D. in Electrical and Computer Engineering from Johns Hopkins University,
				where I worked with Prof. Vishal M. Patel. Before that, I completed my M.S. at The Chinese
				University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen, advised by Prof. Rui Huang.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="https://kfmei.com">Research website</a> ·
				<a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&user=e_nu_TIAAAAJ">Google Scholar</a> ·
				<a href="https://x.com/KangfuM">X</a>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
